# v3 is not deployed to Vercel (brief §2 D5): SQLite, proctoring snapshots, a background job
# worker and an SSE feed all need a persistent disk and a long-running process. See the
# "Deploying v3 (VPS)" section of the README.
#
# Everything is excluded so a still-connected Vercel project uploads nothing. vercel.json is the
# one exception: without it the build dies on "vite: command not found", because package.json
# never arrived. With it, the build says why it stopped.
*
!vercel.json
